k"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段見られないレアなところがあったり、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(´ｰ｀)(´ｰ｀)(´ｰ｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言えないのがもどかしいぜ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/_pre/blog/haruka.kaki/img/2021/05/05/9734423/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいらちゃんが撮ってくれた写真。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごい楽しそうに階段を、降りてるわたし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"階段降りるのって楽しいよね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、駅の階段に限ってこけるんよいつも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんなんやろなぁ、あの現象"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"転けて涼しい顔するの上手い自信あるよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1年前の今日の私がね、ブログ更新してて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それを読み返してみたんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テンションがよくわからんくて謎でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問コーナーでもね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「◎神染めるなら何色がいい？ 」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「A.神を...染めるだと......？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ていう謎な質問＆回答で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ネオンジェネシスやなって思った"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でね、まだリレーブログしてたの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次はさあちゃんだよって言ってて、一人のブログになってからまだ一年も経ってないみたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2年前の今頃は横浜アリーナでの4期ライブの練習を頑張ってた気がする。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうそんなに経ったのか〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"成長できてるのかなぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの時、私のペンライトが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オレンジ×緑　で、緑色使ってるのが4期生で私しかいなかったからすごく見つけやすくて嬉しかったの☀︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブのオープニングの演出も大好きで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"光が集まってきて、それが落ちた先に私たちがいて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこから4番目の光が流れるっていうのが大好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのライブは、死ぬ間際まで見ると思う。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それくらい大切で、大好きなライブです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16人になって二回目の4期生ライブ、無観客の配信ライブだけど頑張るぞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4期生の熱を伝えるぞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5/8、よろしくお願いします！☀︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また明日ね(ง ˙˘˙ )ว"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"賀喜遥香"}],"source":"official"},"ofc-hina-58378":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"そろそろ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドーム意識しちゃってる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ども、ポカです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/S__55869484_0.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"SHOWROOMを見ておわかりのように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポカはおやすみで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みーぱんの誕生日に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒にいられなかったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとおくれてのはっぴーばーすでーブログです〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもちゃんと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しゅざいはしました〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・リハーサルやレッスンなどで必ず場の空気を和ませてくれる（by じゃーまね）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなご想像のとおり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みーぱんはリハやレッスンでも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みーぱんなのです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みーぱんじゃないみーぱんをポカは見たことがありません〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・どんなこともポジティブに変換してくれる（by じゃーまね）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まちがいなくハッピーオーラをつくりあげてきたひとりといっても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かごんではない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのメンタルはポカもみならいたいところです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きょうたべてもだいじょうぶ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたからなんとかなる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたやろうはばかやろー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ともいうらしいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じんせいってむすかしい〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・いつでもどんな時でも周りの事を考えて行動してくれる（by じゃーまね）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう講演会すればいいとおもう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最強のメンタルと組織のマネジメント論"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"講師：佐々木美玲"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いちまんえんはらいます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・表情豊かなので表情筋を凄い使ってそう（by じゃーまね）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポカはおどろいたときのみーぱんがおきにいりです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/S__55869482_0.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろんえがおもさいきょう〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つづいてはめんばーから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・キムチやニンニクなどの食べ物が好きでそれをメンバーにも勧めてくれる(by まなふぃ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発酵食品と滋養強壮のさいきょうしょくざいがみーぱんのフィジカルも支えているとは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とんでもなくストイックなせいかつをしているのでは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・この間、みーぱんさんのことをなんとなく美玲さんと呼んだら、「なんか違和感！」と言われたので、今は「ぱんさん」と呼んでいます！(by 金村)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずなぜなんとなく美玲さんとよんだのか、たまに金村のへんなところ発動するよね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぱんさんだと、もはやなまえのかけらものこってないけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それをゆるしてるみーぱんの寛大さ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"許す勇気論"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"講師：佐々木美玲"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いちまんえんはらいます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・みんなのためにライブでプロテインを持ってきて、みんなに飲みな！と勧めてくれて嬉しかったです(by ひなの)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかちょっとほんとに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いんすとらくたーなのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パーソナルトレーナー佐々木美玲"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いちまんえん／月"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はらいます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/S__55869485_0.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というわけで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつのまにかみーぱんに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さんまんえんもはらったポカですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひとついえるのはまちがえなく日向坂の大黒柱"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほわっとゆらっとしてるのにガッチり芯がある"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょうかっこいいってことがわかったとおもいます〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなかまねはできないですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポカもふんわりぼでぃながら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"芯のふといイケてる鳥になれるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どりょくどりょくどりょく〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あらためて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みーぱん誕生日おめでとう〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らいしゅうにむけて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めんばーといっしょにあしたからもがんばろう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポカ"}],"source":"official"}}